## CPTAC/build_cptac.R
## ============================================================================
## Build datasets/cptac.db -- the CPTAC Pan-Cancer proteogenomic data freeze
## (BCM harmonized, GENCODE v34; Li et al., Cancer Cell 2023) in the T2 schema.
## Implements CPTAC/SPEC.md (binding). Data generated by the National Cancer
## Institute Clinical Proteomic Tumor Analysis Consortium (CPTAC).
##
## RUN (container, repo root /home/rstudio/R/T2):
##   Rscript CPTAC/build_cptac.R
## Smoke build:
##   CPTAC_OUT=/home/rstudio/R/T2-devdata/scratch/cptac-smoke.db CPTAC_SUBSET_GENES=800 \
##   CPTAC_COHORTS=CCRCC,OV Rscript CPTAC/build_cptac.R
## Env knobs: CPTAC_OUT, CPTAC_COHORTS, CPTAC_TYPES, CPTAC_SUBSET_GENES, CPTAC_CHUNK.
## CPTAC_LIB_ONLY=1 defines the helper functions and stops (used by test_cptac.R).
## The data files are untrusted downloads: read with fread, never sourced.
## ============================================================================

